    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "まり",
    "text": "「まぁ、そんなとこかねぇ。どうにも、最近ちょっと疲れぎみでね。あたしも、いいかげん歳かねぇ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 55,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「ふふ。疲れているなら、ゆっくり休んでいくといいよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「お茶ぐらいならだすし、話ぐらいなら聞くよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 55,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
